      "location": "Proof step 3.1",
      "defect": "unlicensed-inference",
      "evidence": "Step 3.1 says, “Transport all attaching tubes to $M_a$ with the same regular flow” and cites [F4]. But [F4] is `lem-gradient-flow-identifies-the-local-and-global-attaching-regions`, whose Statement requires that the closed band have “exactly one critical point of value $c$.” The proposition instead assumes $m$ critical points, and step 1.1 explicitly takes disjoint charts for all of them. Thus [F4] cannot be applied to this band to transport all tubes. A direct regular-band flow argument below $c-\\varepsilon$ would repair the step, but that argument is not supplied or cited by a dependency with applicable hypotheses.",
